0.7.2

- Fix CI: switch to yourlabs/python image (updated nightly) from the
  stale yourlabs/python-arch image (3 years without updates).
- Fix CI: resolve test_view_get ordering dependency — widget_templates
  isolation now drops URL conf modules from sys.modules before each test
  so simple.py's @widget_template decorators always re-run.
- Fix CI: improve assert_equals failure output with unified diff.
- Fix CI: register asyncio marker and pytest-asyncio dependency.
- Fix CI: remove unknown CHANNELS_ENABLE pytest config option.
- Fix CI: suppress RuntimeWarning from app initialization DB access.
- Fix CI: rename Test1/Test2 component fixtures to Comp1/Comp2 to avoid
  PytestCollectionWarning.
- Re-enable test_ws_connected and test_register_changed (require
  PostgreSQL; were incorrectly skipped with a misleading reason).

0.7.1

- Add 18-feature showcase in ryzom_django_example/simple.py covering
  nesting, attrs, style/sass bundles, CList, Markdown, slots, @template
  wrappers, context bubbling, event handlers, Web Components, form
  rendering, @widget_template, and scripts/stylesheets.
- Add SYNTHESIS.md: full project overview for all 8 packages.
- Fix py2js transpiler compatibility with Python 3.12: ast.Num/ast.Str
  removed, use node.value fallback; standalone methods with self as
  first arg were emitting ES6 method shorthand instead of function
  declarations — add _in_class tracking in visit_ClassDef to fix.
- Fix ryzom.js event delegation: handlers received this=window instead
  of the DOM element; changed call to .call(target, event).

0.7.0

- BACKWARD COMPATIBILITY BREAK: Escape HTML in text by default like in Django
  templates.
- Tag name is autogenerated for subclasses of Component which provide an
  HTMLElement: no need to specify it manually anymore.
- At the same time, tag name generation has been moved from constructor to
  metaclass.
